  complete 1440

step Smeed Scrabblescrew
  tip Smeed's camp is on the road south of Kolkar Village, by the Kodo Graveyard.
  accept 5561

step Kodo Graveyard
  tip Use Smeed's Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged Kodo and walk the tamed kodo back to his camp, five times; Aged Kodos also drop the hides.
